    B.LegalSection_kh5 = new A.LegalSection("1. Who we are", "xStore operates this marketplace app. For Egypt\u2019s Personal Data Protection Law No. 151 of 2020 we act as the data controller of account and order data you submit in the app.");
    B.LegalSection_rdY = new A.LegalSection("2. Data we collect", "Account: name, email, Egyptian mobile number, role (buyer/vendor), password or sign-in tokens. Profile and store details you enter. Orders: delivery address, recipient phone, items, notes. Device: app version, language, and approximate location (latitude/longitude headers used so nearby listings can load). We do not collect card PAN, CVV, or bank details.");
    B.LegalSection_aKu = new A.LegalSection("3. How we use it", "To run your account, verify your phone, place and fulfill COD orders, show relevant listings, send order notifications, prevent fraud, and improve the app. Approximate location is used for catalog search, not ads.");
    B.LegalSection_rAr = new A.LegalSection("4. Sharing", "When you order, the vendor receives what they need to deliver (name, address, phone, items). Couriers receive what they need after an order is confirmed. We use processors such as hosting, authentication, and push (e.g. Firebase). We do not sell your personal data.");
    B.LegalSection_IZ1 = new A.LegalSection("5. Analytics", "The app queues product-analytics events (views, checkout, purchase) to xStore\u2019s own collector when that route is live. This is not advertising tracking and is not sold to ad networks.");
    B.LegalSection_CFl = new A.LegalSection("6. Retention and security", "We keep data while your account is open and as needed for orders, disputes, and legal obligations, then delete or anonymize it. Transport uses TLS. Auth tokens stay on device.");
    B.LegalSection_XUI = new A.LegalSection("7. Your rights", "You may access and correct profile data in the app, and delete your account from Profile. You may withdraw marketing consent in Notification settings (on this device until a server sync exists). You may also contact the competent Egyptian authority.");
    B.LegalSection_xrN = new A.LegalSection("8. Children", "The app is not for anyone under 18. We do not knowingly collect data from minors.");
